  The first four entries are as BVB sent them, and show the shape the mapping
  has to survive: one entry per announcement rather than per company, so a
  company that announced in several years appears once per year.

  The last two are added, because the recorded window happened not to contain
  them and the mapping has to cope with both: a lower-case symbol, and an entry
  with no usable symbol at all.
-->
